    "layout": "The page is a broad white editorial canvas with a persistent split header: compact pill navigation on the left, a centered two-line wordmark, and availability plus conversion control on the right. The opening hero is left-aligned, led by a large multi-line serif/sans/italic statement, a short explanatory line, filter-like industry tags, and a black pill; beneath it, an unequal-width horizontal collage of raw case-study crops creates the visual counterweight. Subsequent sections use long white intervals: a centered client-proof row, a centered manifesto with a small visual swatch sequence and offset project cards, then a split FAQ with utility copy left and questions right. Social proof resolves as three unboxed testimonial columns, preserving the page's spacious, text-led rhythm.",
